{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 4,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 478.193,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, I, Nephi, speak concerning the prophecies",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.431,
      "end": 5.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of which my father hath spoken,",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.887,
      "end": 8.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning Joseph, who was carried into Egypt.",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.353,
      "end": 12.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, he truly prophesied concerning all his seed.",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 12.877,
      "end": 15.153,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the prophecies which he wrote,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 15.333,
      "end": 17.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there are not many greater.",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 17.278,
      "end": 19.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he prophesied concerning us,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 19.687,
      "end": 21.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and our future generations;",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 21.864,
      "end": 25.208,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are written upon the plates of brass.",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 25.888,
      "end": 31.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, after my father had made an end of speaking concerning the prophecies of Joseph,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 31.827,
      "end": 34.056,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he called the children of Laman,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.236,
      "end": 36.326,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "his sons, and his daughters,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 36.506,
      "end": 38.131,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto them:",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 38.311,
      "end": 44.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, my sons, and my daughters, who are the sons and the daughters of my firstborn,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 44.9,
      "end": 47.872,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should give ear unto my words.",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 48.552,
      "end": 50.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the Lord God hath said that:",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 50.775,
      "end": 53.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Inasmuch as ye shall keep my commandments",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 53.834,
      "end": 55.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall prosper in the land;",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 56.011,
      "end": 59.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and inasmuch as ye will not keep my commandments",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 59.395,
      "end": 61.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall be cut off from my presence.",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 62.629,
      "end": 64.905,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, my sons and my daughters,",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 65.085,
      "end": 67.035,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I cannot go down to my grave",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 67.215,
      "end": 69.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save I should leave a blessing upon you;",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 69.949,
      "end": 74.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, I know that if ye are brought up in the way ye should go",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 74.773,
      "end": 76.538,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye will not depart from it.",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 77.218,
      "end": 79.308,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, if ye are cursed,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 79.488,
      "end": 81.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, I leave my blessing upon you,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 82.176,
      "end": 84.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the cursing may be taken from you",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 84.724,
      "end": 87.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be answered upon the heads of your parents.",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 88.237,
      "end": 90.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, because of my blessing",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 90.553,
      "end": 93.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord God will not suffer that ye shall perish;",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 93.844,
      "end": 96.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, he will be merciful unto you",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 96.439,
      "end": 98.343,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and unto your seed forever.",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 99.023,
      "end": 105.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after my father had made an end of speaking to the sons and daughters of Laman,",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 105.658,
      "end": 109.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he caused the sons and daughters of Lemuel to be brought before him.",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 110.239,
      "end": 112.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he spake unto them, saying:",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 112.602,
      "end": 117.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, my sons and my daughters, who are the sons and the daughters of my second son;",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 117.751,
      "end": 120.305,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold I leave unto you the same blessing",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 120.485,
      "end": 123.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I left unto the sons and daughters of Laman;",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 123.684,
      "end": 126.842,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, thou shalt not utterly be destroyed;",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 127.022,
      "end": 129.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but in the end thy seed shall be blessed.",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 130.256,
      "end": 134.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when my father had made an end of speaking unto them,",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 134.848,
      "end": 137.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, he spake unto the sons of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 138.093,
      "end": 140.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and even all his household.",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 141.002,
      "end": 143.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after he had made an end of speaking unto them,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 144.108,
      "end": 146.012,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he spake unto Sam, saying:",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 146.192,
      "end": 148.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Blessed art thou, and thy seed;",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 148.74,
      "end": 152.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou shalt inherit the land like unto thy brother Nephi.",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 152.867,
      "end": 155.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thy seed shall be numbered with his seed;",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 155.973,
      "end": 158.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou shalt be even like unto thy brother,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 159.079,
      "end": 161.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thy seed like unto his seed;",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 161.581,
      "end": 164.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou shalt be blessed in all thy days.",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 164.722,
      "end": 173.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass after my father, Lehi, had spoken unto all his household, according to the feelings of his heart and the Spirit of the Lord",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 173.865,
      "end": 175.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was in him,",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 175.438,
      "end": 176.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he waxed old.",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 177.011,
      "end": 180.122,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he died, and was buried.",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 180.802,
      "end": 184.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that not many days after his death,",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 184.279,
      "end": 190.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Laman and Lemuel and the sons of Ishmael were angry with me because of the admonitions of the Lord.",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 191.136,
      "end": 195.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I, Nephi, was constrained to speak unto them, according to his word;",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 196.053,
      "end": 198.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I had spoken many things unto them,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 198.787,
      "end": 201.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also my father, before his death;",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 201.475,
      "end": 204.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "many of which sayings are written upon mine other plates;",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 205.092,
      "end": 209.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for a more history part are written upon mine other plates.",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 209.719,
      "end": 212.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And upon these I write the things of my soul,",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 212.825,
      "end": 217.144,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many of the scriptures which are engraven upon the plates of brass.",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 217.324,
      "end": 219.739,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For my soul delighteth in the scriptures,",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 219.919,
      "end": 222.148,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my heart pondereth them,",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 222.328,
      "end": 226.368,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and writeth them for the learning and the profit of my children.",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 227.048,
      "end": 230.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, my soul delighteth in the things of the Lord;",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 230.247,
      "end": 232.941,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my heart pondereth continually upon the things",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 233.121,
      "end": 234.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I have seen and heard.",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 235.659,
      "end": 242.346,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, notwithstanding the great goodness of the Lord, in showing me his great and marvelous works,",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 242.526,
      "end": 244.244,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my heart exclaimeth:",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 244.424,
      "end": 246.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O wretched man that I am!",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 246.415,
      "end": 249.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, my heart sorroweth because of my flesh;",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 249.242,
      "end": 251.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my soul grieveth because of mine iniquities.",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 252.662,
      "end": 256.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am encompassed about, because of the temptations and the sins",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 257.114,
      "end": 259.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which do so easily beset me.",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 259.837,
      "end": 261.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when I desire to rejoice,",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 261.921,
      "end": 264.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my heart groaneth because of my sins;",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 264.423,
      "end": 267.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, I know in whom I have trusted.",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 268.029,
      "end": 270.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My God hath been my support;",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 270.206,
      "end": 273.828,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he hath led me through mine afflictions in the wilderness;",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 274.008,
      "end": 277.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he hath preserved me upon the waters of the great deep.",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 278.171,
      "end": 282.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "He hath filled me with his love, even unto the consuming of my flesh.",
      "verse": "4:21",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 282.938,
      "end": 287.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "He hath confounded mine enemies, unto the causing of them to quake before me.",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 288.216,
      "end": 290.445,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he hath heard my cry by day,",
      "verse": "4:23",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 290.625,
      "end": 294.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he hath given me knowledge by visions in the night-time.",
      "verse": "4:23",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 294.834,
      "end": 298.317,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And by day have I waxed bold in mighty prayer before him;",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 298.497,
      "end": 300.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, my voice have I sent up on high;",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 301.092,
      "end": 303.925,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and angels came down and ministered unto me.",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 304.605,
      "end": 307.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And upon the wings of his Spirit",
      "verse": "4:25",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 307.2,
      "end": 310.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "hath my body been carried away upon exceedingly high mountains.",
      "verse": "4:25",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 310.77,
      "end": 313.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And mine eyes have beheld great things,",
      "verse": "4:25",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 313.644,
      "end": 315.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even too great for man;",
      "verse": "4:25",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 315.728,
      "end": 318.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I was bidden that I should not write them.",
      "verse": "4:25",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 319.38,
      "end": 321.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O then, if I have seen so great things,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 321.928,
      "end": 325.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if the Lord in his condescension unto the children of men",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 325.73,
      "end": 328.284,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "hath visited men in so much mercy,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 328.464,
      "end": 330.089,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "why should my heart weep",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 330.269,
      "end": 333.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my soul linger in the valley of sorrow,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 333.189,
      "end": 334.861,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my flesh waste away,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 335.041,
      "end": 338.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my strength slacken, because of mine afflictions?",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 339.25,
      "end": 342.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And why should I yield to sin, because of my flesh?",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 342.634,
      "end": 345.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, why should I give way to temptations,",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 345.508,
      "end": 348.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the evil one have place in my heart",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 348.521,
      "end": 351.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to destroy my peace and afflict my soul?",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 351.209,
      "end": 353.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Why am I angry because of mine enemy?",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 354.165,
      "end": 355.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Awake, my soul!",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 355.645,
      "end": 357.27,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "No longer droop in sin.",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 357.45,
      "end": 359.122,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Rejoice, O my heart,",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 359.302,
      "end": 362.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and give place no more for the enemy of my soul.",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 363.186,
      "end": 365.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do not anger again because of mine enemies.",
      "verse": "4:29",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 365.827,
      "end": 369.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do not slacken my strength because of mine afflictions.",
      "verse": "4:29",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 369.851,
      "end": 371.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Rejoice, O my heart,",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 371.703,
      "end": 373.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cry unto the Lord, and say:",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 373.88,
      "end": 376.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord, I will praise thee forever;",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 376.521,
      "end": 378.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, my soul will rejoice in thee,",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 378.93,
      "end": 381.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my God, and the rock of my salvation.",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 382.304,
      "end": 383.326,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "4:31",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 383.506,
      "end": 385.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wilt thou redeem my soul?",
      "verse": "4:31",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 385.404,
      "end": 388.933,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wilt thou deliver me out of the hands of mine enemies?",
      "verse": "4:31",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 389.113,
      "end": 392.968,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wilt thou make me that I may shake at the appearance of sin?",
      "verse": "4:31",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 393.648,
      "end": 395.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "May the gates of hell",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 395.593,
      "end": 397.822,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "be shut continually before me,",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 398.002,
      "end": 399.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because that my heart is broken",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 400.179,
      "end": 401.99,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my spirit is contrite!",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 402.17,
      "end": 404.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord, wilt thou not shut",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 404.3,
      "end": 407.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the gates of thy righteousness before me,",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 407.22,
      "end": 410.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may walk in the path of the low valley,",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 410.558,
      "end": 412.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may be strict in the plain road!",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 413.653,
      "end": 414.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 414.855,
      "end": 418.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wilt thou encircle me around in the robe of thy righteousness!",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 418.75,
      "end": 419.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 419.952,
      "end": 423.667,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wilt thou make a way for mine escape before mine enemies!",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 423.847,
      "end": 426.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wilt thou make my path straight before me!",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 426.535,
      "end": 429.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wilt thou not place a stumbling block in my way\u2014",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 429.641,
      "end": 432.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that thou wouldst clear my way before me,",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 432.515,
      "end": 435.859,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hedge not up my way, but the ways of mine enemy.",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 436.539,
      "end": 437.561,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 437.741,
      "end": 439.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have trusted in thee,",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 439.686,
      "end": 441.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will trust in thee forever.",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 441.863,
      "end": 444.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will not put my trust in the arm of flesh;",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 444.783,
      "end": 446.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I know that cursed is he",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 447.053,
      "end": 449.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that putteth his trust in the arm of flesh.",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 449.927,
      "end": 453.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, cursed is he that putteth his trust in man",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 453.218,
      "end": 455.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or maketh flesh his arm.",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 455.709,
      "end": 459.424,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I know that God will give liberally to him that asketh.",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 459.604,
      "end": 461.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, my God will give me,",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 461.456,
      "end": 462.942,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if I ask not amiss;",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 463.122,
      "end": 465.862,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I will lift up my voice unto thee;",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 466.042,
      "end": 467.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I will cry unto thee,",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 468.033,
      "end": 470.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my God, the rock of my righteousness.",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 470.489,
      "end": 473.74,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, my voice shall forever ascend up unto thee,",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 473.92,
      "end": 476.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my rock and mine everlasting God.",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 476.701,
      "end": 477.537,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 159
    }
  ]
}